@block libs.agents
purpose agent roles, agent loop, sandbox, tickets, routing
kind    leaf
thread  any
est     L
fn      run_ticket(id) -> Result<Outcome>
fn      design(idea) -> Result<Outcome>
call    libs.llm:send
call    libs.runner:test
call    libs.index:view
call    libs.code:check_drift
call    libs.metrics:cost_usd
use     libs.core
inv     the orchestrator never receives source code
inv     a worker writes only impl/ and tests/unit/ of its own leaf
